<style>
  .help-panel {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding-top: 2;
    padding-bottom: 2;
    padding-left: 3;
    padding-right: 3;
    background-color: rgba(0, 8, 17, 0.92);
    border-color: #00ff88;
    border-width: 0.12;
    border-radius: 1.2;
  }
  .help-title {
    font-size: 3;
    color: #00ff88;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 1.5;
  }
  .help-section {
    font-size: 1.8;
    color: #00ffff;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 1;
    margin-bottom: 0.5;
  }
  .help-text {
    font-size: 1.2;
    color: #aabbbb;
    margin-bottom: 0.3;
  }
  .help-key {
    font-size: 1.2;
    color: #ffdd00;
  }
  .back-btn {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding-top: 0.6;
    padding-bottom: 0.6;
    padding-left: 2;
    padding-right: 2;
    margin-top: 1;
    background-color: rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.06);
    border-color: #ff00ff;
    border-width: 0.06;
    border-radius: 0.4;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .back-text { font-size: 1.6; color: #ff00ff; }
</style>
<div class="help-panel">
  <span class="help-title">HOW TO PLAY</span>
  <span class="help-section">BROWSER CONTROLS</span>
  <span class="help-text"><span class="help-key">WASD / Arrows</span> - Move claw</span>
  <span class="help-text"><span class="help-key">Space</span> - Drop claw</span>
  <span class="help-text"><span class="help-key">Escape</span> - Pause</span>
  <span class="help-section">VR CONTROLS</span>
  <span class="help-text"><span class="help-key">Right Thumbstick</span> - Move claw</span>
  <span class="help-text"><span class="help-key">Right Trigger</span> - Drop claw</span>
  <span class="help-text"><span class="help-key">B Button</span> - Pause</span>
  <span class="help-text"><span class="help-key">Laser Pointer</span> - Menu interaction</span>
  <span class="help-section">GAMEPLAY</span>
  <span class="help-text">Position the claw over a prize</span>
  <span class="help-text">Drop it to grab! Claw strength varies</span>
  <span class="help-text">Heavier/rarer prizes are harder to grab</span>
  <span class="help-text">Consecutive grabs build combo multiplier</span>
  <span class="help-section">GAME MODES</span>
  <span class="help-text">Classic - Limited drops, maximize score</span>
  <span class="help-text">Time Attack - Race against the clock</span>
  <span class="help-text">Target - Grab specific highlighted prizes</span>
  <span class="help-text">Progressive - Gets harder each round</span>
  <span class="help-text">Daily - Same layout for everyone today</span>
  <span class="help-text">Marathon - Play until 3 misses</span>
  <span class="help-text">Precision - Only 3 drops, make them count</span>
  <span class="help-text">Practice - No pressure, unlimited plays</span>
  <span class="help-section">PRIZES</span>
  <span class="help-text">Common (grey) - Easy to grab, 100 pts</span>
  <span class="help-text">Uncommon (green) - Medium, 200-250 pts</span>
  <span class="help-text">Rare (blue) - Harder, 500 pts</span>
  <span class="help-text">Epic (purple) - Very hard, 1000 pts</span>
  <span class="help-text">Legendary (gold) - Near impossible, 2500 pts</span>
  <div id="btn-back-help" class="back-btn"><span class="back-text">BACK</span></div>
</div>
